# Sazacap's Brew: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card" (CR 601.2b, 118.8). The Brew has already left the hand when the cost is paid
# (CR 601.2a), so it can't be the discarded card: on turn 1 Bot1 empties the rest of its hand onto the battlefield and the Brew is refused though its
# mana is there to pay. On turn 3 it draws an Island, discards it as the cost, and Bot2 (the target player) draws two.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Sazacap's Brew
Memnite
Mountain
Ornithopter
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x15

